    "summary": "fix(tokenUsage): usage comment honours config.tracker.provider (ADO) — gh-942",
    "description": "Fixes #942. When no tracker/config/trackerProvider is passed, postTokenUsageComments now loads the project config best-effort so config.tracker.provider=ado is honoured. Explicit tracker/config/customParams.trackerProvider keep priority (config not even loaded); loader failure falls back to the old Jira default. 3 new tests."
  }
